        <name>processMCDCRecord</name>
        <qualifiedname>anonymous_namespace{CoverageMapping.cpp}::MCDCRecordProcessor::processMCDCRecord</qualifiedname>
        <briefdescription>
<para><ref refid="classllvm_1_1sys_1_1_process" kindref="compound">Process</ref> the MC/DC <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_record" kindref="compound">Record</ref> in order to produce a result for a boolean expression. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>This process includes tracking the conditions that comprise the decision region, calculating the list of all possible test vectors, marking the executed test vectors, and then finding an Independence Pair out of the executed test vectors for each condition in the boolean expression. A condition is tracked to ensure that its <ref refid="namespacellvm_1_1_calling_conv_1abdf8cf606905c10634e831390981b0ed" kindref="member">ID</ref> can be mapped to its ordinal position in the boolean expression. The condition&apos;s source location is also tracked, as well as whether it is constant folded (in which case it is excuded from the metric). </para>
        </detaileddescription>
